Subject: [PATCH 08/90] launcher: download the mods Java mods require (plug and
 play)

Before Play (with Fabric 26.3 mods on) and with 'java-mods deps', the required mods the jars of mods-java/ name in fabric.mod.json but nobody put there are found on Modrinth (Fabric, 26.3) and downloaded, SHA-512 checked, for up to 4 rounds (what those need too). Ids the game or Horizon provide (minecraft, java, fabricloader, Fabric API and its modules) and what a jar carries inside it (jar-in-jar, provides) are never fetched. What can't be found is said plainly; the game still starts.

Tested: Biomes O' Plenty + Waystones alone -> Balm, GlitchCore, Shogi, TerraBlender downloaded in 3 s; a second run finds nothing missing.
